3">da </span><span begin="02:44.093" end="02:44.513">re </span><span begin="02:44.513" end="02:44.969">mo </span><span begin="02:44.969" end="02:45.213">ga </span><span begin="02:45.213" end="02:45.653">shi </span><span begin="02:45.653" end="02:46.013">n </span><span begin="02:46.013" end="02:46.213">ji </span><span begin="02:46.213" end="02:46.813">ta</span></text><text for="99740d9f-7070-4a77-9e86-67f92c56b6c5"><span begin="02:47.053" end="02:47.413">a </span><span begin="02:47.413" end="02:47.616">i </span><span begin="02:47.616" end="02:47.929">no </span><span begin="02:47.929" end="02:48.293">yu </span><span begin="02:48.293" end="02:48.673">ku </span><span begin="02:48.673" end="02:48.893">e </span><span begin="02:48.893" end="02:49.373">wo</span></text><text for="line-ae19c524-a187-46d1-95a6-725084bfcb20"><span begin="02:49.573" end="02:49.733">i </span><span begin="02:49.733" end="02:49.913">ma </span><span begin="02:49.913" end="02:50.193">wa </span><span begin="02:50.193" end="02:50.453">ma </span><span begin="02:50.453" end="02:50.842">da </span><span begin="02:50.947" end="02:51.093">ko </span><span begin="02:51.093" end="02:51.273">no </span><span begin="02:51.273" end="02:51.653">mi </span><span begin="02:51.653" end="02:51.873">chi </span><span begin="02:51.873" end="02:52.373">wa</span></text><text for="a99e1f95-8f28-40fe-af7f-a048ea62264a"><span begin="02:52.373" end="02:52.553">ki </span><span begin="02:52.553" end="02:52.775">bo </span><span begin="02:52.775" end="02:53.088">u </span><span begin="02:53.088" end="02:53.233">no </span><span begin="02:53.233" end="02:53.593">to </span><span begin="02:53.593" end="02:54.040">chu </span><span begin="02:54.040" end="02:54.362">u </span><span begin="02:54.362" end="02:54.520">ni </span><span begin="02:54.520" end="02:54.693">a </span><span begin="02:54.693" end="02:55.393">ru</span></text><text for="line-d72114de-7fe6-451f-a232-68e19aaceb32"><span begin="02:55.493" end="02:55.853">me </span><span begin="02:55.853" end="02:56.053">wo </span><span begin="02:56.053" end="02:56.427">to </span><span begin="02:56.427" end="02:56.593">ji </span><span begin="02:56.593" end="02:56.800">ta </span><span begin="02:56.800" end="02:57.319">ma </span><span begin="02:57.319" end="02:57.500">ma </span><span begin="02:57.500" end="02:58.101">de</span></text><text for="773edede-1f5a-4aa2-8d7d-e9e7b938e418"><span begin="02:58.314" end="02:58.727">e </span><span begin="02:58.727" end="02:58.913">ga </span><span begin="02:58.913" end="02:59.773">ku </span><span begin="03:00.133" end="03:00.329">a </span><span begin="03:00.329" end="03:00.513">shi </span><span begin="03:00.513" end="03:00.723">ta </span><span begin="03:00.723" end="03:01.000">no </span><span begin="03:01.000" end="03:01.346">ki </span><span begin="03:01.346" end="03:01.573">se </span><span begin="03:01.573" end="03:06.653">ki</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle"><text for="line-960a02c3-b59a-4266-a505-0eb0cb80357e">我们终有一日会再</text><text for="663e9dcb-a5db-4f05-9db9-4b7038eb8c1e">回到那个地方</text><text for="line-02d3b22d-6d3b-4d5f-ae01-59b2d029ed7e">长长的绵延不绝的</text><text for="99f8f26f-f97b-46ce-a5c6-cd4e0759351f">道路前方</text><text for="line-dae08392-68ca-4325-9f51-7468bc1dbc9d">连梦中也曾见过的景色</text><text for="9de61549-9373-4066-8fff-49b4644f3692">摇曳在画面中</text><text for="line-399c3aa9-aaf2-4667-8c9b-0bb46e4617cc">可不知为何偏偏在这一天</text><text for="47884adc-768a-4952-95c6-33a385c23de3">不安前来作祟 刹那间</text><text for="line-29bdfd9a-0fdb-4cb9-a612-3bc91578b719">心儿轻飘飘地随风起舞 fly away</text><text for="line-f94630a7-20aa-4ca8-9ef1-a8aff3a21502">我们终有一日会再</text><text for="766fde3d-7e4a-4d2b-ae16-de605773c87b">回到那个地方</text><text for="line-48d16878-f896-49ff-8602-7320f521b977">少女的眼泪所指引的真理</text><text for="line-e4718ee4-7d01-4de1-866d-e72815b2fd59">如今这条道路依然</text><text for="c03e6ded-b2ec-4932-9793-07c9754d0e28">在希望的途中</text><text for="line-3827e84e-7cb4-46f4-86cf-c530dc46998d">就这样闭着双眼</text><text for="6ee6984c-5701-4972-a603-1ee0fe0b176a">描绘出明天的奇迹</text><text for="line-c6d07b5a-c5af-4697-a25d-eada7da1f25c">长长的无边无际的</text><text for="344ce9d7-5fb1-4570-bf91-5eaa8b90693a">国道 穿行而过</text><text for="line-50fd1b53-1693-49ef-b2bc-42d9f8788f23">朝着令人目眩的世界</text><text for="1578777d-c00f-456e-9984-dfbc951765f2">飞身跃入</text><text for="line-2d2f3fe7-548b-4adf-aefb-c6403acaf41e">在遥远记忆的彼方</text><text for="fe4540a9-8981-482e-a487-e1452fb66cb6">浮现又消逝的少女之梦</text><text for="line-d4650bf2-501b-4ac1-8c21-f3ab0c305dd1">在心中轻飘飘地融为一体 fly away</text><text for="line-9a3eb86f-92e5-4c45-aa76-927a94f136c0">我们向着广阔天空</text><text for="0ae27c5f-0ba0-4222-9471-b87a14eea62c">许下约定的清晨</text><text for="line-65f12d97-b472-4020-a6d6-3b9ef4dd76d4">鸟儿的喧噪</text><text for="079d3b78-1f54-4cbd-9644-d483e8869ff2">哀叹着未来</text><text for="line-2da9b885-d9c5-48c4-80c9-52e1ad9f9907">那种事我明白</text><text for="460a7502-d5ef-4620-aae4-67a60ac5c39a">深深沉没的记忆</text><text for="line-3dfe7678-42af-4ad3-898c-17b56dd2916a">已不再是孤身一人</text><text for="1f2f01f4-d9e3-40b6-a554-bf74bf6260f7">将生命连接向明天</text><text for="line-8611273d-a54f-444a-b5c1-069a3a4707b9">想在心间 轻柔地传达 fly away</text><text for="line-ae6a8380-9171-4742-ac26-9ca6226fc8ac">我只是向着你的梦</text><text for="44304ede-0efe-4e86-a15f-598a0c3c859e">追逐着奔跑</text><text for="line-f7ad6fb5-7fb8-4db7-b03c-aa704d7d1963">任谁都曾相信的</text><text for="99740d9f-7070-4a77-9e86-67f92c56b6c5">爱的去向</text><text for="line-ae19c524-a187-46d1-95a6-725084bfcb20">如今这条道路依然</text><text for="a99e1f95-8f28-40fe-af7f-a048ea62264a">在希望的途中</text><text for="line-d72114de-7fe6-451f-a232-68e19aaceb32">就这样闭着双眼</text><text for="773edede-1f5a-4aa2-8d7d-e9e7b938e418">描绘出明天的奇迹</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:06.653"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-960a02c3-b59a-4266-a505-0eb0cb80357e" itunes:key="line-960a02c3-b59a-4266-a505-0eb0cb80357e" begin="00:00.082" end="00:02.964" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:00.082" end="00:00.52